Hello everyone,

Please welcome Ben, who joins the London delivery team as a driver on Monday 6 July.

Ben has driven for a parcel company for five years, so he knows the city well. For his first two weeks he will ride with Tom on the central London route. After that he will take over the east London route, which covers about 30 offices.

On his first morning Ben will be at the London warehouse from 07:00 for his induction, the van check and the safe lifting training. If you see him around the warehouse or the office, please say hello and help him find his way.

Drivers, please make sure the spare trolley in bay 3 is cleared out by Friday so Ben can use it.

Kind regards,
Lee
